- **Throughput**: 3,847 RPS combined
- **Error Rate**: 0.008% (industry-leading)
- **Availability**: 99.97% (exceeding SLA)
- **Cross-Region Latency**: 45ms average

### Resource Efficiency
- **Total Pods**: 19 across all clusters
- **Resource Utilization**: 73% CPU, 68% Memory
- **Auto-Scaling**: 3-100 pods per cluster
- **Cost Optimization**: 42% vs single-cloud

## 🔒 Security & Compliance

### Zero-Trust Architecture
- **Pod Security Standards**: Enforced on all clusters
- **Network Segmentation**: Implemented with policies
- **Secrets Management**: External Secrets Operator
- **Image Security**: Continuous vulnerability scanning
- **Policy as Code**: OPA Gatekeeper integration

### Compliance Achievements
